Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.90,0:01:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's tame the octopus\Nand make him pull our ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.62,0:02:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a good look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.25,0:02:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you don't have to take\Na good look since it's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.79,0:02:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.21,0:02:12.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We're dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been around for\Nseveral hundred years!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kraken appears in many\Nmyths in the world -
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,it's like a visionary creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no bones and I'm a\Nskeleton without any flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It has no bones and I'm a\Nskeleton without any flesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.60,0:02:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the polar opposite of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.11,0:02:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You're quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.61,0:02:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see this kind of thing often, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Sketching? How relaxed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.82,0:02:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll help you but do you\Nhave any plan, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.62,0:02:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is that we're in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is the size of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be dangerous\Neven if we were on land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.59,0:02:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.43,0:03:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of situation\Nwhen everybody agrees to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.59,0:03:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,run away at full speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.43,0:03:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Shift the helm to the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.68,0:03:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, go straight towards the octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.11,0:03:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,--The octopus will...\N--Whoa, whoa, Nami-san. I'm here for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.28,0:03:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...here for...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You held it! Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the rehabilitation\Nand to Nami for wearing a coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.62,0:03:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous to be on this ship!\NI've got to protect myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's coming from behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They came back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.38,0:03:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Coribou! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.22,0:03:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,--We're gonna save my brother!\N--Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.18,0:03:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You came back to save me, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--The coating popped!\N--That ship is even bigger than Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.16,0:04:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.42,0:04:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,--They look like a school of jellyfish.\N--Shut up, Roronoa! Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.56,0:04:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,--It's too big!\N--How can we fight against it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Gear...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:38.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll break the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.32,0:04:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Chicken Voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.95,0:04:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we... get away somehow?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.91,0:04:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do anything! I'll beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.12,0:04:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No! You're gonna break the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:05:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen! If you wanna fight against\Nit that much, here is an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.47,0:05:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.84,0:05:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.31,0:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the extra-vehicular\NFlutter Kick Coating!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.40,0:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,An extra-vehicular diving suit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.65,0:05:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're in it, you can\Nfight as you want even in water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.82,0:05:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let these fools do whatever\Nthey want, I'll be in danger too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.07,0:05:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have done that, stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.61,0:05:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted to run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, they're gonna fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you guys to run from the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but that Captain-san won't listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.46,0:05:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you rather they fought on this ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.63,0:05:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, good luck! Go far away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This rope is annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.22,0:05:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away from this ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.85,0:05:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,--Okay, let's go!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.85,0:06:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! You have to attach the safety rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.32,0:06:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be separated!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.90,0:06:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san's worrying about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.24,0:06:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys! Draw his attention for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.70,0:06:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat him with one strong blow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.49,0:06:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I could beat him right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't cut him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I want the octopus as a pet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.30,0:06:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay as far away as you\Ncan! Even a millimeter...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.55,0:06:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's attacking us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Move aside, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Something is in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,--A shark?\N--Isn't that shark wearing something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.03,0:09:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fairly big.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.25,0:10:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been swept away\Nby the downward current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! Follow them! We have to stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.32,0:10:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,--I don't wanna die here!\N--You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,--You're still here?\N--You're too calm!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.54,0:10:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are spinning! But I don't have eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.96,0:10:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep the yard level! Hard to Port!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna crash into the continental shelf!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.97,0:10:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your concentration,\Nor the ship will wreck!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.93,0:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get thrown off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in the center of the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.20,0:11:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why are you all so glum?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I know! You guys can't\Ndo anything without me...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't find Luffy and the\Nother two. We got separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.88,0:11:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.42,0:11:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope they haven't been\Nshredded to pieces by the monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Your imagination is terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dark - I wanna look for\Nthem but I can't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.43,0:12:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good with darkness.\NI feel something, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably submerged around 7,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.15,0:12:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the Shark Submerge can't\Ntake the pressure this deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we near the Fish-Man Island?\NMaybe they got there already...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.37,0:12:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Camie-chan said it's located\Nat 10,000 meters below sea level.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.33,0:12:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to submerge 3,000 meters more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.54,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,All they have is a small bubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.46,0:12:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if they're alive,\Nthere isn't enough air so it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.09,0:12:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I told them to\Nattach the safety rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.76,0:12:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't accomplish anything\Nstanding around like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's look for them. I now have a search light.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.06,0:12:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it your eyes?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...Nipple Lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.86,0:12:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.05,0:12:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.80,0:13:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.73,0:13:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's a jellyfish! There's a\Nmassive jellyfish above us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.86,0:13:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's huge! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They're twinkling! Like stars in the night!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.16,0:13:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.42,0:13:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a tentacle!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Do you wanna be my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably venomous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! A little...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.14,0:14:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,...Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The jellyfish got eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.78,0:14:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we lost some air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Better than getting eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.03,0:14:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Coup de Burst is a weapon that\Nshoots a fair amount of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.45,0:14:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But since we're in the water,\Nwe only have a limited amount of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So when we shoot the air\Nout, the bubble shrinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.84,0:14:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. But it makes me nervous\Nto see the bubble shrinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the deep sea is always dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nthere are many creatures with rudimentary eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.39,0:15:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So they can't see well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Fools! See this? Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.52,0:15:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But there are some with developed eyes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? How can I see things without eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you people wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.13,0:15:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The answer is... Tum, tum, tum, tum, tum...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...a secret!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you talking to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No problem. I'm used to being lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.81,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop fooling around and look for them!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.31,0:15:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I get hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.15,0:15:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji! Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.32,0:15:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.49,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This rope must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.16,0:16:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you seen that pirate guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, he's still here!\NI totally forgot about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.88,0:16:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him since we got this deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.38,0:16:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he got thrown off\Nduring the downward pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.89,0:16:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His hands and legs were tied up so\Nhe couldn't hold on to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:21.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Well but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.06,0:16:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...he untied himself. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-Then, he's somewhere\Non the ship? Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got to be hiding somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.24,0:16:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.58,0:16:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sneak into the girls' room--\Nif that's what you want, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.61,0:17:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.57,0:18:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh no! Shoot! Dammit!\N--Now he can't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.99,0:18:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How did he get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't paying attention. If he\Nwasn't so stupid, we could be in danger now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.83,0:18:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,His body wasn't taking form.\NIt has melted like mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.46,0:18:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,--Like mud?\N--Yeah, I'm sure it's a Devil Fruit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He must've eaten a Logia-type fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.38,0:18:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He was only pretending to be caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:29.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get me out of here, mister!\NMister in swimshorts!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.85,0:18:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll become your servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.43,0:18:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. I feel hot all of the sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stand the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot! What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.86,0:18:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this? Smoke?\NIt's blocking our view forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.90,0:18:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoke from the sea floor? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.78,0:18:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.37,0:18:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydrothermal deposits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.37,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hydrothermal deposits!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.83,0:19:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,--A volcanic area in the sea!\N--What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.05,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, you can see that there\Nwere volcanic eruptions here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get away from here!\NIf it erupts, we're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.60,0:19:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hot... It's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.44,0:19:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.06,0:19:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Carnivorous Tubeworms!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.40,0:19:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.69,0:19:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A little Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Faceless Crabs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.12,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A little Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.45,0:19:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even know what they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,A little Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The deep sea's scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others can't survive here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to get sad.\NI finally got to see him after 2 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.09,0:20:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out! They're not gonna die so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I used Coup de Burst little by\Nlittle but we lost so much air.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?! It's so bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.28,0:20:18.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the Fish-Man Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think Luffy and the others are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't submerged\Nanother 3,000 meters yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.20,0:20:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,"WHO-ARE-YOU?"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.12,0:20:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! What are you sending\Nthe flashing signals with?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.21,0:20:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,--Do you see anything?\N--No, it's still too bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an angler! He tricked us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We were fooled by the deep-sea hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We're totally trapped! Can we get away...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.53,0:21:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it this time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I-Is it a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.70,0:21:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster in the sea that looks like a man...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Sea Bonze!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna capsize the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.76,0:21:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ankoro! You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat ships! How many\Ntimes do I have to tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain Vander Decken-sama won't like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.36,0:21:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did he help us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! We have to get away\Nanyway! He is a monster too!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.60,0:21:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,--Dead men tell no tales, they have no desire.\N--Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,--...me?\N--In the dark land where even crows can't fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.40,0:22:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dead men don't need jewels on their finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.33,0:22:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even see\Nsomebody's sorrow in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.75,0:22:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look for it! Look for it!\NSunken treasures are mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.30,0:22:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the richest person in the\Nworld - Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me it's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.69,0:22:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Even in the sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.41,0:22:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A ghost ship?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.24,0:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned! For no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought that you were\Na ghost at that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.14,0:23:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,We thought that you were\Na ghost at that moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.23,0:23:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That is the real one! Look at that sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The infamous Flying Dutchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.32,0:23:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't exist in the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.70,0:23:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened several hundred years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.95,0:23:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One stormy day, the captain of the\Npirate ship suddenly lost his mind
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.58,0:23:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and killed all his crew by throwing\Nthem into troubled waters one by one!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.80,0:23:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And he even cursed the gods!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.68,0:23:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The name of the captain was Vander Decken
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.90,0:23:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and the ship was the Flying Dutchman!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The gods got mad at him
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.27,0:23:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,and set him adrift forever\Nunder constant tortured!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ship right in front of us is\NCaptain Vander Decken's haunted ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.98,0:23:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.02,0:23:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.56,0:24:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't seize their treasure\Nif you eat the ship
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.32,0:24:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so knock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.78,0:24:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.49,0:24:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,--Oh no, the Sea Bonze is...\N--He's our enemy after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,--Franky, use Coup de Burst!\N--I can't! The fuel has run out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.41,0:24:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to fill up with\Ncola in the energy room!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.21,0:24:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.17,0:24:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,--No!\N--He's gonna get us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.44,0:24:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.20,0:24:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Monster of the Arctic--Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.03,0:25:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's enough. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.71,0:25:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.91,0:25:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.32,0:25:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.70,0:25:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad that you're all alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.50,0:25:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.33,0:25:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami-san! Robin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been looking for you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.59,0:25:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so high-maintenance. They got lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.29,0:25:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He needs rehab with less stimulating pics!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.75,0:25:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Wake up, Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.38,0:25:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Avenge yourself! Get back at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.76,0:25:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Sanji's bubble and mine\Npopped so we got into Zoro's.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.64,0:25:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.35,0:25:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make us worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.27,0:25:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, here's a song to\Ncelebrate your return.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.90,0:26:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Lots of space!  There's no place like home!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.77,0:26:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy! I was scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.24,0:26:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You all have an amazing ability to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.03,0:26:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!\NYou really tamed the monster octopus?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.16,0:26:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And are you gonna use the Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.83,0:26:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm gonna use him like\Nexperienced people do!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.54,0:26:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.67,0:26:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a squid snack!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.13,0:26:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kraken is an octopus but\Nhe named it Surume, oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.51,0:26:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, draw the Sunny, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.27,0:26:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, instead of making him draw the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.40,0:26:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to make sure that\Nhe's not gonna smash it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.90,0:26:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, the pirate ship is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.44,0:26:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it get away! Go after it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.24,0:26:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.20,0:26:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.82,0:27:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is no good, Captain Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.87,0:27:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, the undersea volcano's gonna erupt!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.50,0:27:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He blew it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotten so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gotten so much stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.09,0:09:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Even while he's in the sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.31,0:10:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay in the center of the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.98,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-san! Zoro-san! Sanji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In this vast, submerged expanse,\Nthe Sunny Eyes don't help that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.57,0:13:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're stuck...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.20,0:13:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The darkness is stirring up our anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.37,0:13:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, we're not getting\Nanywhere. What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.67,0:13:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stop the ship so try\Nnot to overlook anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That fish that got bitten\Nturned upside down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.15,0:14:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So they contain a neurotoxin as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The deep sea's scary! It's dark too...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.33,0:14:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of fish with\Nwhite eyes... It's creepy here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.20,0:16:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! We have enough problems already
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nbut now we have to look out for him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.72,0:16:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares! He's not that strong anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.45,0:16:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.42,0:17:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Those formidable 3 who were fighting\Nagainst the Kraken went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.21,0:17:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way they could have\Nsurvived after getting lost
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,with just those bubbles to protect them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.92,0:17:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a shame that I couldn't kill Straw Hat
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.84,0:17:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can prove that he's dead by killing
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.18,0:17:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,\Nthese crewmembers and taking their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.94,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't rush, Caribou!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.27,0:17:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't rush!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.85,0:17:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kill them here, there's no one else to sail the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They navigate the ship pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as you get to the Fish-Man Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.66,0:17:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you all will be dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.24,0:22:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I turned! For no reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.36,0:23:55.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And the ship right in front of us is\NCaptain Vander Decken's haunted ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.20,0:24:50.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Monster of the Arctic--Kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,--It deflected the tentacle!\N--How powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.91,0:06:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And... another one!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does it keep coming after us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit a sea mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit a sea mount!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huge hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--That's our Robin! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Even underwater, I managed it\Nbecause it was only a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Even underwater, I managed it\Nbecause it was only a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Color of Arms Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.62,0:08:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The sea is sapping my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn octopus!\NIs it trying to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sanji-{\i1}san{\i} left his bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that! Look at that speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a Fish-Man! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ran and ran...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...from those abominations for two years.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Compared to them,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the monster is nothing.\NIt actually looks rather cute to me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.57,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...Grill Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Three Sword Style Secret Move!\NCrossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa! Zoro! Sanji!\NIt can't pull our ship without its tentacles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They got a hard hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.06,0:07:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Huge hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--That's our Robin! We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--Nice, Robin! You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--Nice, Robin! You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.19,0:07:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Although I'm in water,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.49,0:07:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was okay because it\Nwas just a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.22,0:07:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,They did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.67,0:07:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, it's my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the new technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Gear Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:02.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Color of Arms Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That damn octopus!\NIs it trying to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.17,0:08:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.09,0:08:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Sanji-{\i1}san{\i} left his bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that! Look at that speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.72,0:08:28.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He's like a Fish-Man! Cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.51,0:08:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I ran and ran...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.43,0:08:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...from those abominations for two years.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.85,0:08:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Compared to them,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.60,0:08:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the monster is nothing.\NIt actually looks rather cute to me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.02,0:08:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.57,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.28,0:08:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...Grill Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.58,0:09:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Three Sword Style Secret Move!\NCrossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.35,0:09:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa! Zoro! Sanji!\NIt can't pull our ship without its tentacles!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.67,0:09:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He knocked it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.81,0:11:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.52,0:11:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.37,0:24:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.06,0:06:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.78,0:06:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,--It deflected the tentacle!\N--How powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.00,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--Well done!\N--Yeah, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.51,0:07:06.09,Default,,0,0,0,,--Well done!\N--Yeah, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.83,0:08:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel weak because of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.09,0:06:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.52,0:06:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,--Got it!\N--How powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,--Got it!\N--How powerful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.84,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, another arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does he keep attacking us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna hit us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guard Boost!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.36,0:06:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,They got a hard hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.07,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.89,0:07:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,H-He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,--Well done!\N--Yeah, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna hit the mountain!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.85,0:07:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.10,0:07:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What big hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.48,0:07:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yes!\N--Nice, Robin! You saved us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. Although I'm in water,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.06,0:07:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I was okay because it\Nwas just a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.06,0:07:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Gear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Armament; Hardening!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel weak because of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that octopus! Is it trying to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn that octopus! Is it trying to stop him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.88,0:08:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Sanji-san got out of the bubble!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really fast!\NHe's like a Fish-Man! That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been running and running
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.44,0:08:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,in order to get away from those hideous people for 2 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.62,0:08:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the monster is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It actually looks rather cute to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.01,0:08:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.22,0:08:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...Grill Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-Sword Style technique;\NCrossing the Six Paths!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey hey, Zoro! Sanji! You can't cut his arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.05,0:09:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.64,0:09:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,...Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.80,0:09:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He blew it away!
